---
source: crates/lastcall/tests/test_e2e_tui_snapshots.rs
expression: frame
---
"┌ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ ↑ / k          previous entry / scroll up              v              select lines               │"
"│ ↓ / j          next entry / scroll down                y              copy selection             │"
"│ PgUp / b       page up                                 i              edit in place              │"
"│ PgDn / Space   page down                               I              $EDITOR at the hunk        │"
"│ ⏎ / l / →      open the diff                           d              ack the agent flag         │"
"│ Esc / h / ←    back to the file list (close help)      g              jump to the agent in herdr │"
"│ Tab            toggle focus                            w              workspace scope on/off     │"
"│ n / ]          next hunk                               r              rescan now                 │"
"│ p / [          previous hunk                           e              expand a collapsed file    │"
"│ t              hide / show empty repos                 f              full paths                 │"
"│ a              accept the hunk or the selected entry   o              show org/repo              │"
"│ A              accept the whole file                   s              snooze this repo           │"
"│ Ctrl-A         accept everything listed                S              show / hide snoozed repos  │"
"│ u              restore the hunk                        ?              this help                  │"
"│ U              restore the whole file                  q / Ctrl-C     quit                       │"
"│ z              undo the last accept                    y / ⏎          confirm                    │"
"│ m              flag it with a note                     n / Esc        cancel                     │"
"│ M              clear the file's flags                                                            │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ ^J is a newline in the note (⇧⏎ needs a kitty-protocol terminal)                                 │"
"│ shift+drag selects text (mouse capture is on) · v/y copies                                       │"
"│ lastcall tui --tour shows the welcome again                                                      │"
"│ any key closes                                                                                   │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
